{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "videoId": "claude-code-api-config",
  "voice": {
    "name": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "+25%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "volume": "+0%"
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "01",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "01-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-01/01-01.mp3",
          "text": "你明明已经通过 /login 登录了 Max，为什么 API 账单还在持续增加？",
          "duration": 5.376
        },
        {
          "id": "01-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-01/01-02.mp3",
          "text": "问题可能不在登录，而在环境里还留着一个优先级更高的 API key。",
          "duration": 5.208
        },
        {
          "id": "01-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-01/01-03.mp3",
          "text": "登录进去，不等于当前用对了身份。",
          "duration": 2.856
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 13.44
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "02",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "02-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-02/02-01.mp3",
          "text": "先别急着复制命令，先判断自己属于哪种使用场景。",
          "duration": 4.32
        },
        {
          "id": "02-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-02/02-02.mp3",
          "text": "个人日常的交互式开发，优先用订阅登录。",
          "duration": 3.336
        },
        {
          "id": "02-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-02/02-03.mp3",
          "text": "要嵌进脚本、CI，或者按团队用量结算，才考虑 API key。",
          "duration": 5.088
        },
        {
          "id": "02-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-02/02-04.mp3",
          "text": "它们不是同一套账，也不是同一种使用方式。",
          "duration": 3.288
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 16.032
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "03",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "03-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-03/03-01.mp3",
          "text": "如果你是个人订阅用户，装好 Claude Code 后直接运行 claude。",
          "duration": 4.272
        },
        {
          "id": "03-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-03/03-02.mp3",
          "text": "首次启动会打开浏览器，登录 Claude.ai，完成授权后回到终端。",
          "duration": 5.688
        },
        {
          "id": "03-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-03/03-03.mp3",
          "text": "如果浏览器没有自动打开，可以复制链接。",
          "duration": 3.264
        },
        {
          "id": "03-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-03/03-04.mp3",
          "text": "在远程环境里，也可能需要把登录代码粘贴回终端。",
          "duration": 3.96
        },
        {
          "id": "03-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-03/03-05.mp3",
          "text": "需要换账号时，先使用 /logout。",
          "duration": 2.76
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 19.944
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "04",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "04-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-04/04-01.mp3",
          "text": "需要 API key 时，先在 Claude Console 创建密钥。",
          "duration": 3.84
        },
        {
          "id": "04-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-04/04-02.mp3",
          "text": "再把它配置到 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY，启动 Claude Code 后批准一次。",
          "duration": 5.856
        },
        {
          "id": "04-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-04/04-03.mp3",
          "text": "注意，密钥本身就是钱。",
          "duration": 2.16
        },
        {
          "id": "04-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-04/04-04.mp3",
          "text": "不要写进代码，不要提交 Git，也不要贴进可分享的文件。",
          "duration": 4.296
        },
        {
          "id": "04-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-04/04-05.mp3",
          "text": "画面里的 key 只能是占位符，不能使用真实密钥。",
          "duration": 3.696
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 19.848
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "05",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "05-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-05/05-01.mp3",
          "text": "真正容易出问题的地方在这里：订阅凭证和 API key 可以同时存在。",
          "duration": 5.376
        },
        {
          "id": "05-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-05/05-02.mp3",
          "text": "你可能已经登录了订阅，但环境变量里仍然有 API key。",
          "duration": 4.344
        },
        {
          "id": "05-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-05/05-03.mp3",
          "text": "接下来决定实际身份的，就不是你的主观选择，而是凭证的优先级。",
          "duration": 5.088
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 14.808
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "06",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "06-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-01.mp3",
          "text": "源文档给出的身份优先级，从高到低共有六层。",
          "duration": 3.912
        },
        {
          "id": "06-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-02.mp3",
          "text": "最上面是云提供商。",
          "duration": 1.848
        },
        {
          "id": "06-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-03.mp3",
          "text": "接下来依次是 ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN、ANTHROPIC_API_KEY、apiKeyHelper 和 CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN。",
          "duration": 11.184
        },
        {
          "id": "06-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-04.mp3",
          "text": "最后才是 /login 的订阅凭证。",
          "duration": 2.472
        },
        {
          "id": "06-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-05.mp3",
          "text": "Claude Code 会从上往下检查，跳过空层，停在第一个有值的层。",
          "duration": 4.752
        },
        {
          "id": "06-06",
          "file": "audio/scene-06/06-06.mp3",
          "text": "越靠上的凭证，越可能覆盖下面的凭证。",
          "duration": 3.216
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 27.384
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "07",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "07-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-07/07-01.mp3",
          "text": "回到开场那个案例。",
          "duration": 1.8
        },
        {
          "id": "07-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-07/07-02.mp3",
          "text": "上面的几层大多为空，但第三层 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY 有值，所以扫描到这里就停下来了。",
          "duration": 7.608
        },
        {
          "id": "07-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-07/07-03.mp3",
          "text": "底部的订阅凭证虽然仍然存在，却没有成为实际使用的身份。",
          "duration": 4.608
        },
        {
          "id": "07-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-07/07-04.mp3",
          "text": "这就是为什么 Max 已经登录，账单却还是走 API。",
          "duration": 4.104
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 18.12
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "08",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "08-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-08/08-01.mp3",
          "text": "想切回订阅，就先清掉覆盖订阅的环境变量：unset ANTHROPIC_API_KEY。",
          "duration": 6.984
        },
        {
          "id": "08-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-08/08-02.mp3",
          "text": "这一步不是重新登录，而是移除更高优先级的覆盖源。",
          "duration": 4.2
        },
        {
          "id": "08-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-08/08-03.mp3",
          "text": "然后重新进入 Claude Code，用 /status 查看实际身份。",
          "duration": 4.224
        },
        {
          "id": "08-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-08/08-04.mp3",
          "text": "交互模式里，也可以在 /config 关闭“使用自定义 API 密钥”的开关。",
          "duration": 4.992
        },
        {
          "id": "08-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-08/08-05.mp3",
          "text": "清理之后一定要复查，不要只凭命令执行成功就下结论。",
          "duration": 4.44
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 24.84
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "09",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "09-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-01.mp3",
          "text": "还要注意入口边界。",
          "duration": 1.776
        },
        {
          "id": "09-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-02.mp3",
          "text": "源文档区分了 CLI、Desktop 和 Web。",
          "duration": 3.36
        },
        {
          "id": "09-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-03.mp3",
          "text": "终端 CLI 会读取相关环境变量。",
          "duration": 3.168
        },
        {
          "id": "09-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-04.mp3",
          "text": "Desktop 和远程会话只认 OAuth。",
          "duration": 3.048
        },
        {
          "id": "09-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-05.mp3",
          "text": "Claude Code on the Web 使用订阅凭证。",
          "duration": 2.688
        },
        {
          "id": "09-06",
          "file": "audio/scene-09/09-06.mp3",
          "text": "不要把一个入口的配置方式直接套到另一个入口，然后再把“不生效”误判成配置失败。",
          "duration": 6.0
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 20.04
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "10",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "10-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-01.mp3",
          "text": "身份确认之后，还有一个独立问题：让它用哪个模型。",
          "duration": 4.056
        },
        {
          "id": "10-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-02.mp3",
          "text": "可以把 Opus 看成处理复杂问题的资深工程师。",
          "duration": 3.648
        },
        {
          "id": "10-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-03.mp3",
          "text": "Sonnet 是日常主力。",
          "duration": 2.04
        },
        {
          "id": "10-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-04.mp3",
          "text": "Haiku 适合简单快速的任务。",
          "duration": 2.472
        },
        {
          "id": "10-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-05.mp3",
          "text": "常用别名包括 default、opus、sonnet、haiku、best 和 opusplan。",
          "duration": 5.28
        },
        {
          "id": "10-06",
          "file": "audio/scene-10/10-06.mp3",
          "text": "身份决定用谁的额度，模型决定让谁来干活。",
          "duration": 3.84
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 21.336
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "11",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "11-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-11/11-01.mp3",
          "text": "模型也不是只在一个地方设置。",
          "duration": 2.664
        },
        {
          "id": "11-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-11/11-02.mp3",
          "text": "源文档给出的优先级是：会话内的 /model 最高。",
          "duration": 3.792
        },
        {
          "id": "11-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-11/11-03.mp3",
          "text": "其次是 claude --model、环境变量 ANTHROPIC_MODEL，最后是 settings.json。",
          "duration": 6.168
        },
        {
          "id": "11-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-11/11-04.mp3",
          "text": "所以，身份优先级和模型优先级要分别理解。",
          "duration": 4.2
        },
        {
          "id": "11-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-11/11-05.mp3",
          "text": "前者回答“用谁的额度”，后者回答“实际运行哪个模型”。",
          "duration": 4.2
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 21.024
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "12",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "12-01",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-01.mp3",
          "text": "最后实际检查一次。",
          "duration": 1.848
        },
        {
          "id": "12-02",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-02.mp3",
          "text": "进入 claude，用 /status 查看当前账户、身份和模型。",
          "duration": 4.416
        },
        {
          "id": "12-03",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-03.mp3",
          "text": "用 /model 查看或切换模型。",
          "duration": 2.472
        },
        {
          "id": "12-04",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-04.mp3",
          "text": "退出后检查 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY，必要时执行 unset，再回到 Claude Code 用 /status 复查。",
          "duration": 7.656
        },
        {
          "id": "12-05",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-05.mp3",
          "text": "你能说清楚当前用的是订阅还是 API key，运行的是哪个模型，这篇的核心目标就完成了。",
          "duration": 6.768
        },
        {
          "id": "12-06",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-06.mp3",
          "text": "下一条视频会继续解决一个自然延伸的问题。",
          "duration": 3.672
        },
        {
          "id": "12-07",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-07.mp3",
          "text": "既然请求可以通过不同身份发送，能不能把 Claude Code 接到第三方或国产模型？",
          "duration": 5.76
        },
        {
          "id": "12-08",
          "file": "audio/scene-12/12-08.mp3",
          "text": "线索是 ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 改变请求发到哪里，而不是改变用哪个模型。",
          "duration": 6.84
        }
      ],
      "narrationDuration": 39.432
    }
  ]
}
